{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013ZdeodpnZ5UWzJT5f3hprD","type":"tool_result","content":"- `mover.tire` †: { climb, climbJump, glide, sprint } it costs\n- `mover.turn = 14` †: how fast it turns, radians a second\n- `mover.vault = 14` †: walls up to this high are vaulted at a run\n- `mover.wall = null` †: the face it holds on to (map.wall's), or null\n\n## 17d. Perception\n\n20:- Collision, standing, sight (`map.sight`, `map.ray`), reach (`E.targets`, `E.inArc` with `dz`) and navigation (`E.FlowField`) all follow these rules. `E.dist` is 3D; `E.overlap` is flat.\n73:- 815 Flow field; E.FlowField: flow\n817:- `new E.FlowField(map, o = {}) → flow`: new E.FlowField(map, { step: 2, climb: 0, drop: 0, jump: 0 }): distances over the tops a body can stand on (E.HEIGHTS). With no options it covers the floor (and walls no higher than step, which bodies walk over); a \n818:- `new E.FlowField({ step, climb, drop })`: next-door cells connect when their tops differ by at most step, or going up by up to climb and down by up to drop (agents that climb walls or hop down)\n819:- `new E.FlowField({ jump })`: (world units) links tops across a gap that a jump clears, straight along a row or column, by map.landing's rules (up to jumpRise higher, 11, and jumpDrop lower, 18): an agent with E.Mover's leap chases across roofs. With jump\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium__20261102-184349__x8b64cc/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6b59097-524b-47da-837f-b83180a4d05e","uuid":"487158f6-8886-4da6-9a60-905bdfa1fd15","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:48:41.220Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"- `mover.tire` †: { climb, climbJump, glide, sprint } it costs\n- `mover.turn = 14` †: how fast it turns, radians a second\n- `mover.vault = 14` †: walls up to this high are vaulted at a run\n- `mover.wall = null` †: the face it holds on to (map.wall's), or null\n\n## 17d. Perception\n\n20:- Collision, standing, sight (`map.sight`, `map.ray`), reach (`E.targets`, `E.inArc` with `dz`) and navigation (`E.FlowField`) all follow these rules. `E.dist` is 3D; `E.overlap` is flat.\n73:- 815 Flow field; E.FlowField: flow\n817:- `new E.FlowField(map, o = {}) → flow`: new E.FlowField(map, { step: 2, climb: 0, drop: 0, jump: 0 }): distances over the tops a body can stand on (E.HEIGHTS). With no options it covers the floor (and walls no higher than step, which bodies walk over); a \n818:- `new E.FlowField({ step, climb, drop })`: next-door cells connect when their tops differ by at most step, or going up by up to climb and down by up to drop (agents that climb walls or hop down)\n819:- `new E.FlowField({ jump })`: (world units) links tops across a gap that a jump clears, straight along a row or column, by map.landing's rules (up to jumpRise higher, 11, and jumpDrop lower, 18): an agent with E.Mover's leap chases across roofs. With jump","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium__20261102-184349__x8b64cc/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013ZdeodpnZ5UWzJT5f3hprD","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
